35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The data confirms my suspicion. A full pass takes one hundred and two minutes. The firm’s terms require pre-tidying, so outsourcing doesn’t remove the labor, it just shifts it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
